ent-WeaponRifleSR127 = SR-127 Bauer bolt action rifle
    .desc = The Bauer SR-127 is the standard issue bolt action rifle used by the United Earth Gov. Known for its long range accuracy and use by marksmen despite its age and lack of IFF. It has an irremovable scope. Uses .60 anti-material magazines.
ent-WeaponSniperRemington700 = Remington 700
    .desc = A .308 Winchester hunting rifle, produced by third parties from Earth Armories replicas. Features a polymer frame.
ent-WeaponRifleDragunov = Dragunov
    .desc = A semiautomatic sniper rifle, famed for its marksmanship, and is built from the ground up for it.
